     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Dear MSstats users,</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">We invite you to submit abstracts for oral presentations and posters for this year&#39;s Computational Mass Spectrometry Track at ISMB 2018 (Sat. Jul 7, 2018</span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">).</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">ISMB 2018 will feature a one-day track on computational mass spectrometry with reviewed papers, invited talks, abstract presentations, and a poster session.</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">If you have exciting new results you would like to share with your peers, we would encourage you to submit your abstract for (15 min) oral presentations and posters at</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"http://www.iscb.org/ismb2018-submit/ismb2018-abstracts\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.iscb.org/ismb2018-submit/ismb2018-abstracts&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231777473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0BK3zkiH-0CY3GxA8VqjwR\">www.iscb.org/ismb2018-submit/ismb2018-abstracts</a><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">(Make sure that you select &#39;CompMS COSI&#39; when submitting the abstract!)</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Deadline for abstract submission is April 5, 2018.</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">The CompMS COSI committee</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">(Viktoria Dorfer, Lukas Käll, Oliver Kohlbacher</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Chen Meng, Bill Noble, Veit Schwämmle, Olga Vitek)</span></div>"
